OL,4,CChris Mason: Immigration stats       W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GNet migration falling to the tens of W5
OL,7,Gthousands is a landmark moment in    W5
OL,8,Gour collective national conversation W5
OL,9,Gabout immigration over the last      W5
OL,10,Gcouple of decades.                   W5
OL,11,                                      W5
OL,12,GThere is a simple reason for this.   W5
OL,13,GWe have had years and years strewn   W5
OL,14,Gwith the litter of politicians       W5
OL,15,Gpromising to cut net migration to    W5
OL,16,Gunder 100,000 annually.              W5
OL,17,                                      W5
OL,18,GBut it never happened, until now.    W5
OL,19,                                      W5
